          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Underbite is not for navigation. Tides, currents, depths, charts and every other value it shows are for planning a day on the water only. They can be wrong, late or missing. Never rely on them to steer a vessel or to judge a hazard, and always follow official charts, notices and local regulations." : {
